252	  // ring #1 and the depth-54 slot on ring #2 (scratch projection with the locked 05 camera). The river keeps its width
253	  // (its edge at depth 40 projects where the ref river edge is): between the river and the wall foot a level bank
254	  // floor just under the water line (TubeGeoOptions.floor) — the ref fills it with foam banks. Blends in after the
